It contains an independent re-implementation of the mask-slot decision head of Laya
(Convai Innovations, https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/Laya), which is distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, so that Laya checkpoints and sbert2s1 cross-head models share one
layout. The typed-decision request schema (choice / score / noul) follows the public Jev/Laya
specification.

